*
* Example: Slit(xmin=-0.01, xmax=0.01, ymin=-0.01, ymax=0.01)
*          Slit(xwidth=0.02, yheight=0.02)
*          Slit(radius=0.01)
*
* The Slit won't issue a warning if run as "closed"
* 
* %P
* 
* *
* %E
